**Given:**

The value of the expression: {4 - 3 × [7 - 8 × (2 × 4 - 10)]}

Concept used:

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d4d295550b9de3075718413c37d6065d8a24374d60a3ac0807a98b717585d85d.png] 

**Calculation:**

{4 - 3 × [7 - 8 × (2 × 4 - 10)]}

⇒ {4 - 3 × [7 - 8 × (8 - 10)]}

⇒ {4 - 3 × [7 - 8 × (-2)]}

⇒ {4 - 3 × [7 +16]}

⇒ 4 - 69

⇒ - 65

**The correct answer is -65.**
